#: kk_media_package.py:99
msgid "Python descripon for Enhance Image"
msgstr "Creates a stack of enhancement layers for the active image using ported GIMP 2 logic.\n Parameters: image (Gimp.Image), drawable (Gimp.Drawable).\n Output: Enhancement layers grouped for further editing."

#: kk_media_package.py:100
msgid "procedure description for Enhance Image"
msgstr "This procedure enhances the image by adding multiple adjustment layers such as white balance, detail equalization, and contrast/grey mix.\n It is intended for use on RGB images and returns the enhanced image with new layers grouped under a common group."

